{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2025,5,14]],"date-time":"2025-05-14T04:00:35Z","timestamp":1747195235194,"version":"3.40.5"},"reference-count":0,"publisher":"Uniwersytet Mikolaja Kopernika\/Nicolaus Copernicus University","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["TMNA"],"abstract":"<jats:p>We study properties of an operator $S$ which assigns to compact subsets\nof $[0,1]$ their centers of distances.\nWe consider its continuity points and its upper semicontinuity points as well\nas orbits and fixed points of this operator. We also compute centers of distances\n of some classic sets.  Using properties of operator $S$ we show that the family of\n achievement sets is of the first category in the space of compact subsets of $[0,1]$.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.12775\/tmna.2023.023","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2024,1,2]],"date-time":"2024-01-02T08:15:37Z","timestamp":1704183337000},"page":"1-15","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":1,"title":["On the operator of center of distances between the spaces of closed subsets of the real line"],"prefix":"10.12775","author":[{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0003-3055-4728","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Artur","family":"Bartoszewicz","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-1137-9648","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Ma\u0142gorzata","family":"Filipczak","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-2883-0941","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Gra\u017cyna","family":"Horbaczewska","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-6767-6174","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Sebastian","family":"Lindner","sequence":"additio